{"version":1,"content":"<p>資深藝人李龍基與前未婚妻王青霞（Chris）的一段「忘年戀」早前風波不斷，最終以分手收場。</p><p>李龍基日前出席《EYT友好會聯歡晚宴》，與一眾圈中老友聚首一堂。</p><p>精神不俗的他受訪時罕有開腔，細訴分手後的心理狀態、財務狀況，以及與前度之間的最新進展。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T05:15:57.898212+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T04:48:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T05:09:22.878041+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T05:09:22.878041+00:00","content_hash":"fc8f277fbfb1df3f1eb4bc2e458e2382e98e7dce6981c90193ac37dad1e32ec8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}